@* shadcn's own shape: the control lives in <AlertAction>, pinned to the trailing top corner, and
   the alert reserves the room for it. A link or a form submit, never a click handler — so it
   works before any JavaScript and a middle click opens it in a tab. *@
<Alert Class="max-w-md">
    <AlertTitle>Dark mode is now available</AlertTitle>
    <AlertDescription>Enable it under your profile settings to get started.</AlertDescription>
    <AlertAction>
        <Button Size="xs" Href="/settings/appearance">Enable</Button>
    </AlertAction>
</Alert>
